    "id": "supra-tex",
    "name": "SUPRA-Tex",
    "description": "One photo in, a textured 3D model out: SUPRA-Tex reconstructs the object's geometry from a single view and super-aligns a full PBR material onto it, returning a GLB.",
    "category": "3d",
    "icon": "Box",
    "inputTypes": [
      "image"
    ],
    "workerId": "",
    "cost": "0",
    "processingTime": "300",
    "delay": "12000",
    "overview": "SUPRA-Tex separates the two halves of single-image 3D: Pixal3D's geometry stage predicts a sparse-voxel shape from the photo, DINOv3 and MoGe condition it on the view, and then the SUPRA-Tex completion model generates the unseen material in the Qwen-Image latent space, with a released adapter super-aligning the generated texture to the visible pixels. The cartridge cuts the object out with RMBG-2.0, runs the whole pipeline headless, decimates the mesh and returns the GLB — with its PBR texture — which the canvas orbits in its 3D viewer.",
    "divisible": 32,
